{
  "name": "Conjure Elemental",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A Large elemental spirit: air (Lightning), earth (Thunder), fire (Fire) or water (Cold). While it has no creature Restrained, an enemy that enters its space or starts its turn within 5 ft makes a DEX save: on a failure, 8d8 damage of its type and Restrained until the spell ends. The Restrained creature repeats the save at the start of each of its turns, taking 4d8 on a failure and escaping on a success. +1d8 per slot level above 5th.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
